00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:03,760
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Tracy had to take a vocabulary quiz.

2
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:05,920
She needed her pen.

3
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:09,840
She looked inside her bag, but the pen

4
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:11,120
wasn't in there.

5
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:13,440
It was always there.

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,840
She just used it yesterday.

7
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:19,080
She decided to let it go.

8
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:22,420
She also needed a piece of paper.

9
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:25,300
She looked inside her bag.

10
00:00:25,950 --> 00:00:27,400
There was no paper.

11
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:30,720
Did she leave everything at home?

12
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:33,700
Was she becoming forgetful?

13
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:36,840
Was someone stealing from her?

14
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:39,900
She borrowed paper from a friend.

15
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:42,600
She also needed an eraser.

16
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:45,380
She looked inside her bag.

17
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:46,860
No eraser.

18
00:00:47,640 --> 00:00:50,260
She screamed, oh my god!

19
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:52,720
Her classmates stared at her.

20
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:54,460
She apologized.

21
00:00:55,340 --> 00:00:57,840
Her classmate then pointed at the bottom of

22
00:00:57,840 --> 00:00:58,380
her bag.

23
00:00:59,220 --> 00:01:00,880
There was a huge hole.
